    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34556" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμπυ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύον</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>suffering from an abscess</i> or <i>suppurating
				wound</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
